<h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">1. Data Security & Encryption</h4>
<p class="mb-4">We prioritize the security of sensitive dental data. All data is encrypted using AES-256 standard at rest and TLS/SSL in transit. Each clinic's database is architecturally isolated to ensure no data leakage between different tenants.</p>

<h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">2. Information Collection</h4>
<p class="mb-4">We collect minimal operational data necessary to provide DCMS services, including clinic contact info, owner details, and staff profiles. For patient data, we store names, contact info, clinical records, and X-ray images as uploaded by your staff.</p>

<h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">3. No Data Selling</h4>
<p class="mb-4"><strong>Commitment:</strong> We never sell, rent, or trade your clinic's data or your patients' personal information to third parties. Your data is used exclusively to provide the management platform services you've subscribed to.</p>

<h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">4. Third-Party Services</h4>
<p class="mb-4">Our platform integrates with secure third-party services for specific functions, such as payment processing (e.g., Stripe) and email notifications. These partners only receive the information necessary to perform their respective tasks.</p>

<h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">5. Data Retention</h4>
<p class="mb-4">Patient data is retained for as long as your clinic maintains an active subscription. Upon clinic deletion or termination, data is purged after a grace period of 30 days, unless a data export is requested.</p>
